  heading="0.3.1 — the tools audit themselves"
  intro={`0.3.1 adds no capability. It turns three adversarial audits on tools that were already shipped, and fixes what they found: <strong>39 verified defects</strong>, each reproduced against a real org. Then it fixes the <strong>18 more</strong> that those fixes introduced, because a release that only reports the first number is telling you half of what happened.`}
